+
+    // Keeps the per-question "\u062A\u062D\u0642\u0642 \u0645\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0625\u062C\u0627\u0628\u0629" button's disabled state in
+    // sync with whether there's currently an answer to check \u2014 mirrors
